 <COL N="1512"></COL> ac eliminantur,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI>  In hoc more tollendo S.
Zeno excelluit,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  CXXVII.</ITEM> <ITEM><HI REND="ITALIC">Aggressura, 129 et adn.</HI>  19, 189, 199.</ITEM> <ITEM><HI REND="ITALIC">Agina</HI>  trutinae pars, 267,  <HI REND="ITALIC">adn.</HI>  9.</ITEM> <ITEM>Agnus legalis typus Christi, 282, 283, 291. Agnum bifariae
